<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling down on dollar, up on sterling.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling down on dollar, up on sterling.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling fell slightly against the dollar but rose against sterling on Thursday.</p>
<p>The shilling's commercial mean rate was quoted at 601.9200 to the dollar, compared with Wednesday's 601.6230. Against sterling, the shilling was 979.8084, up from the previous 983.9575. -- Nairobi Newsroom ++ 254 2 330261 REUTER MD FOX</p>
</text>
